					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-517692#post-1499879</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-517692/strangers-of-site-17:343#post-1499879</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 05 Jul 2012 20:12:35 +0000</pubDate>
								<wikidot:authorUserId>1361261</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The second part of a tale written in response to Roget's challenge in the forums to write a tale featuring two SCPs you despise. This time, it's (partly) <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-343">SCP-343</a>. Again, is this 343 in a &quot;positive light&quot;? From the standpoint of &quot;focusing on the most interesting aspects of the article&quot;, I would say so. I found the idea of a being of seemingly limitless power having a profound impact on and daily interaction with site staff to be pretty disturbing. Hope you enjoy it.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
